{'symbol': 'PH', 'date': '2022-08-02 17:00:00', 'title': 'PARKER ELECTS RACHID BENDALI AS VICE PRESIDENT AND PRESIDENT - ENGINEERED MATERIALS GROUP', 'text': 'CLEVELAND, AUG. 02, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- PARKER HANNIFIN CORPORATION (NYSE:PH), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MOTION AND CONTROL TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT RACHID BENDALI, CURRENTLY VICE PRESIDENT, OPERATIONS FOR THE ENGINEERED MATERIALS GROUP, HAS BEEN ELECTED BY THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS AS VICE PRESIDENT AND PRESIDENT – ENGINEERED MATERIALS GROUP.'}